@title New cabinet window: Ctrl+K opens command search instead of typing into the name
@area Hostile
# Pre-work note E-3. In the New cabinet window the name field has the keyboard, so
# a command typed after Ctrl+K became part of the cabinet's name.
fresh
key ctrl+n
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
click_text "New cabinet..." Button
wait 10
expect "New cabinet"
shot new-cabinet-window
key ctrl+k
wait 6
expect_not "Create (Enter)"
text simulate heat
wait 6
shot search-opened
check_layout
key Escape
